# Optional shared classroom gallery. Server-side only; never use VITE_ prefixes.
# Connect Upstash Redis through Vercel Marketplace, then redeploy.
# The API also accepts Marketplace's KV_REST_API_URL + KV_REST_API_TOKEN pair.
# Set one complete pair; the read-only token is not used for saving reports.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
